Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part A}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:01.27,0:00:02.77,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I’m Navi!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:02.77,0:00:06.65,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Matière of Miare City’s \N star detective assistant!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:06.65,0:00:10.22,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I met Liko and Roy and everyone, \N made friends with Metamon,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:10.22,0:00:12.87,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,and my dream of \N catching a Pokémon came true!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:12.87,0:00:18.67,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Riding on the Brave Asagi, \N Navi’s adventure now gets going, going!{is getting going, going}{'begins, begins!'}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:29.68,0:00:31.76,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,All right. Fully installed.
Comment: 10,0:00:31.76,0:00:33.26,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:33.68,0:00:38.39,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,You can use that app to quickly contact \N any of us, your crewmates!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.39,0:00:40.85,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Yeah! The app’s proof you’re one of us!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.60,0:00:44.57,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Now Navi’s part of the Rising Voltteccers!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:44.57,0:00:46.07,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.65,0:00:48.53,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.53,0:00:51.16,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,{\i1}I{\i0} still ain’t accepted you{ though}, y’know.{previously used approve for mitomeru, but accepted here for comparison with businessy Navi}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:51.16,0:00:52.32,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Ult...
Comment: 10,0:00:52.32,0:00:53.66,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,He-heh!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:53.66,0:00:56.87,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I don’t {\i1}need{\i0} Ult to accept me!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:56.87,0:00:59.58,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Navi has Cap’s seal of approval!{おすみつき(comes with a stamp/seal [of approval/guarantee]/'thumbs-up'/etc)}
Comment: 10,0:01:00.29,0:01:01.58,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Rrrrgh...
Comment: 10,0:01:01.58,0:01:02.38,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.84,0:01:07.46,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Navi! C’mon over, everything’s ready.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:10.76,0:01:12.97,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Whoa...!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.97,0:01:16.97,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,This’ll be your room starting today. \N It’s yours to use as you see fit.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:17.56,0:01:19.68,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Thanks, Orio!
Comment: 10,0:01:22.69,0:01:24.06,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:25.73,0:01:28.03,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Wait, wasn’t this room...?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:28.03,0:01:33.57,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Friede’s, yes. He hasn’t been back \N to use it even once, so I cleaned it out!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:33.57,0:01:37.45,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Navi’s room! Navi’s room!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:43.17,0:01:44.75,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,It’s nothin’.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:44.75,0:01:45.84,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Let’s go, Yamirami!
Comment: 0,0:01:48.67,0:01:48.67,Main,,0,0,0,,{Opening}
Comment: 0,0:03:18.76,0:03:18.76,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part B}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.83,0:03:49.75,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I’m Navi. Nice to meet you!{yoroshiku}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.92,0:03:57.47,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,{Hehe! }Let’s be good friends, ‘kay?{yoroshiku}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.47,0:03:59.97,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,There’s still so many faces \N left for me to greet!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.01,0:04:02.64,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,This is the kitchen.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.64,0:04:04.85,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,I prepare everyone’s meals.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.85,0:04:06.60,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.60,0:04:08.56,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,And here’s the sweets.
Comment: 10,0:04:11.65,0:04:13.90,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.28,0:04:16.94,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,If you have any requests \N to add to the menu{献立}, let me know.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.94,0:04:18.45,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,I can make anything you want.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.45,0:04:21.07,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Navi loves omurice!{/fried rice omelettes}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.07,0:04:22.07,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.07,0:04:23.95,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Dinner’s decided, then!{We know what’s on for tonight, then!}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.95,0:04:25.70,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.17,0:04:32.25,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Yep. You’re totally healthy.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.17,0:04:35.59,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,That’s good to hear.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.59,0:04:36.92,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Molly, thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.34,0:04:40.68,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,There’s even a doctor aboard, \N that’s amazing!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.09,0:04:43.47,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,If you ever feel bad, drop right by.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.89,0:04:46.22,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Keep an eye on Metamon, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.64,0:04:50.23,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Keeping your{one’s} partner in good health \N is one of a trainer’s duties, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.19,0:04:52.48,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Partner...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.11,0:04:54.90,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.15,0:04:57.86,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,This is the engine room.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.86,0:05:01.07,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,We take coal, and burn it like this...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:05.45,0:05:08.96,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,...and the energy it produces allows \N the Brave Asagi to fly through the sky!{move}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.96,0:05:11.00,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.00,0:05:12.75,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,But it’s so hot.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.75,0:05:14.88,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Doesn’t look like \N it bothers you, does it, Orio? {TL: How can you take this heat, Orio... "Orio, you do a surprisingly good job being unfazed by it, huh?"}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.92,0:05:17.00,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,{Ahaha! }I’m used to it.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.59,0:05:20.88,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Plus, you could say this room \N is the heart of the ship.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.88,0:05:23.01,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,It’s an important job, so I enjoy it.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.59,0:05:25.68,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,An important job...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.81,0:05:29.35,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Okay, Metamon! We{Navi-tachi} need one, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.23,0:05:32.27,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,A job?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.27,0:05:35.40,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,It’s just so nice how \N everyone on the ship is hard at work!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.77,0:05:38.44,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Navi wants to help out \N with something, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.44,0:05:40.82,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,What would you like to try, Navi?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.82,0:05:42.66,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,No idea! Anything!{same word as Matiere's doing-anything oddjobman phrase last ep}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.66,0:05:44.41,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,A-Anything, huh...?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.41,0:05:46.49,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Then give everything a try!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.49,0:05:48.79,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,First, you can clean the ship with us!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.79,0:05:50.29,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.45,0:06:23.36,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,That way!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.36,0:06:24.11,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.16,0:06:31.91,Main,Gurumin,0,0,0,,Miniguru! Miniguru!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.91,0:06:34.17,Main,Gurumin,0,0,0,,Mini Gurumin!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.84,0:06:39.17,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.17,0:06:40.05,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.44,0:06:59.94,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Yay! This is fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.94,0:07:03.69,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Isn’t it so wonderful when everybody \N does their part, Metamon?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.24,0:07:07.03,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh? Metamon?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.12,0:07:11.16,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.29,0:07:20.71,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,He’s not doing {\i1}any{\i0} job.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:21.59,0:07:23.71,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Wait, Metamon, \N when did you get there?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.26,0:07:26.09,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Give Navi back her Metamon!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.09,0:07:28.34,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-What’s going on?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.26,0:07:34.27,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Nyah-nyah!{142}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.10,0:07:40.15,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,The heck’s her problem?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.65,0:07:45.28,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,That cake tasted so good!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.24,0:07:49.07,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Murdock makes the best sweets \N in the world!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.07,0:07:50.91,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Yeah! I love ‘em!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.33,0:07:56.50,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Sorry, but can someone go into town \N and buy some ingredients for me?{ingredients as in food, directly about food}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.50,0:07:57.87,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,I need something, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.87,0:08:01.59,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,We’re running low on Potions, \N so could you grab some of those, as well?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.59,0:08:05.21,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Errands?! Me! Navi’ll do it!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:05.21,0:08:08.72,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Thanks. \N But I couldn’t let you go alone...{But having you go alone is a bit... [not good}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.72,0:08:10.97,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Right. \N If someone could go with her...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.39,0:08:14.35,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Blah! I can go by myself!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.39,0:08:19.65,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Ult. You go along with her.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.65,0:08:21.61,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Huh?! Why do {\i1}I{\i0} gotta do it?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.61,0:08:25.86,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,You’re not doing anything, \N so at least {\i1}try{\i0} to be helpful.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.24,0:08:27.40,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,What wuzzat?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.40,0:08:30.66,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,You leave me no choice. \N Navi’ll {\i1}let{\i0} you accompany her on her errand!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.66,0:08:32.83,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,You’ve got it backwards! \N Dumb little kid!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.83,0:08:34.87,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,So says the little kid!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.87,0:08:35.49,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.91,0:08:37.75,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Okay then, we’ll leave it to you two.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.75,0:08:39.37,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.75,0:08:41.38,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Geez...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.38,0:08:45.55,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.55,0:08:47.47,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,We’ll be off!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.22,0:08:53.93,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,You think those two’ll be \N okay together, though?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.93,0:08:55.14,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Good question.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.60,0:08:57.89,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Hopefully they won’t \N end up bickering...{"It would be best if they didn't fight." / they had better not fight/argue}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.31,0:09:01.02,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Yeah.{'Yeah that would be best'} That’s why I asked him to go.{"That's why I tried asking [-> Ult to go with her]}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.02,0:09:01.77,Main,Roy Dot,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.77,0:09:04.27,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,I bet they just don’t know \N each other well enough yet.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.65,0:09:07.78,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Plus, Yamirami and Metamon \N get along really well.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.40,0:09:11.07,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,With Pokémon by their sides, \N they’ll be just fine!{Liko line}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.07,0:09:11.91,Main,Roy Dot,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.34,0:09:30.51,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I can see the town!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.76,0:09:35.01,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.01,0:09:37.43,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,So many berries!{ippai}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.27,0:09:40.06,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,I told ya not to act hyper!{I told you not to frolic around [like a kid/=run around having fun] too much!}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.06,0:09:43.65,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I’ve never seen these ones before! \N I wonder what they taste like.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.06,0:09:45.69,Main,Lady,0,0,0,,Want to try one?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.15,0:09:49.86,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Is that okay? Thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.91,0:09:56.99,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Mm! Really juicy!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.29,0:10:00.41,Main,Lady,0,0,0,,Out running errands?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.41,0:10:02.67,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Yeah! Navi has a job!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.67,0:10:05.71,Main,Lady,0,0,0,,Ooh, good for you! \N What are you after?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:05.71,0:10:07.38,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,This was tasty, so I’ll take these!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.38,0:10:10.80,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Hold it! That’s not \N what they asked us to get.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.80,0:10:14.55,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Lessee... These, and these...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.55,0:10:17.10,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Aw man, how many did we need...?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.10,0:10:19.27,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Argh! Gimme fifty each!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.27,0:10:21.56,Main,Lady,0,0,0,,Oh my! {\i1}That{\i0} many?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.56,0:10:24.31,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Three of these, and five of these.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.90,0:10:26.06,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Please and thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.06,0:10:27.44,Main,Lady,0,0,0,,Coming right up!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.44,0:10:31.40,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,You’re so careless! \N Were you even listening to what Murdock said?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.40,0:10:32.28,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Quiet!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.28,0:10:34.07,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,What do you mean, “Quiet”?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.07,0:10:36.28,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,You’re bein’ annoying, \N so I’m sayin’ {\i1}be quiet!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.28,0:10:38.41,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,{\i1}You’re{\i0} the one \N who needs to quiet down, Ult!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.41,0:10:40.08,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,What wuzzat?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.58,0:10:48.46,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Metamon. \N You’re going to the pharmacy with Navi.{Navi-tachi}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.46,0:10:50.50,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Hey, Navi! \N You don’t know what to buy—!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.50,0:10:53.13,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Molly told me, and I {\i1}remembered!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.63,0:10:54.93,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Geez...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.51,0:11:00.35,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Umm... Was it this way?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.56,0:11:06.60,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,The sign said it wasn’t far...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.40,0:11:11.53,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Just... a little bit further...{'It should be... a little bit farther.' Reiterating to herself like '...yeah, I'm on the right track, it must just be a bit further down the alley, nothing to worry about.'}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.74,0:11:20.62,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Where... am I?
Comment: 0,0:11:28.50,0:11:28.50,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part C}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.39,0:11:43.02,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I-I’m fine! I’m not lost!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.64,0:11:47.39,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Yeah! The pharmacy’s \N right around this corner!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.44,0:11:54.74,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Oh, right! \N The Rising Voltteccers app!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.74,0:11:57.20,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,They said it could \N contact them anytime...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.20,0:11:59.03,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh, huh?
Comment: 10,0:11:59.03,0:12:00.78,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.78,0:12:02.53,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I left it back in my room!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:02.53,0:12:04.45,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,What do I do...?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.83,0:12:08.67,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Huh? She hasn’t been here?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.12,0:12:12.63,Main,Man,0,0,0,,I haven’t seen \N a little girl with a Metamon, no.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.21,0:12:17.72,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Well then, for now, \N can I get some Potions...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:17.72,0:12:19.68,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,...and the stuff on this note?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:19.68,0:12:21.93,Main,Man,0,0,0,,Sure. That’ll just be a moment.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:23.26,0:12:24.56,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Geez...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.68,0:12:29.10,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Where’d that Navi \N go wanderin’ off to...?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.77,0:12:35.44,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Huh? “Look for her”?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:35.82,0:12:39.32,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Count me out. \N {\i1}She’s{\i0} the one who wandered off on her own.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.53,0:12:42.99,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,I got it already!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:43.49,0:12:46.33,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Well, I {\i1}am{\i0} her senior{Honorifics note: senpai}, after all...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.70,0:12:49.37,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,When I find her, \N I’m givin’ her a piece of my mind.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.68,0:13:09.52,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,This is bad! \N I can’t find her nowhere!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:11.27,0:13:13.81,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,I should’ve kept a closer eye on her.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:14.19,0:13:15.94,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,If something happens to her...
Comment: 10,0:13:15.94,0:13:18.03,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Eeeeeek!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:27.20,0:13:29.96,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I’m sorry Metamon \N touched your whiskers!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.96,0:13:32.12,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,It was probably just \N curious about you—
Comment: 10,0:13:32.25,0:13:32.96,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Eek!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.96,0:13:35.46,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,No good! It’s not listening at all!{Male Ratta (whisker size), but intentionally using "it".}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.21,0:13:39.09,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Metamon, run for it!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.27,0:13:51.31,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,{\i1}Help...{\i}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:56.98,0:14:00.57,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Finally found ya! \N Lost little kid!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:03.74,0:14:07.20,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I never asked you to \N come and save me, you know...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.20,0:14:09.70,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Hmph. I ain’t even gonna \N lift a finger for ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.70,0:14:10.45,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:11.04,0:14:12.54,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Just look.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:17.67,0:14:19.51,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Metamon... You’re...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.51,0:14:22.26,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,It’s rarin’ to fight to protect you.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.26,0:14:24.59,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,But Navi’s never done \N any kind of battle before...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:24.59,0:14:25.80,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Navi!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:26.51,0:14:29.68,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,You’re a Pokémon Trainer \N who caught a Pokémon, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.18,0:14:33.14,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,What good’s a trainer \N who can’t meet their partner’s feelings?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.14,0:14:35.19,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,A Pokémon Trainer...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:35.19,0:14:39.11,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Don’t worry! \N You’ll have my advice!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.11,0:14:40.86,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Go be with Metamon!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.58,0:14:54.21,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Let’s go, Metamon!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:05.93,0:15:07.93,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Order Metamon to do a move!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.93,0:15:10.22,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Metamon! Transform!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.64,0:15:15.39,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,All right! Now you...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.77,0:15:23.82,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,You’re tiny! \N You’re basically a Koratta!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.28,0:15:26.91,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Don’t sweat it! \N It should be able to use Ratta’s moves!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.24,0:15:29.66,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Uhh, what did it do before...?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:29.66,0:15:30.28,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Bite!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.37,0:15:37.50,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,One more time! Bite, Metamon!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.92,0:15:44.21,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Metamon!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:53.47,0:15:55.48,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,This isn’t working...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.48,0:15:57.90,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Don’t stress out! \N Keep your eye on your foe!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.90,0:16:00.02,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I already {\i1}was!{\i0} \N You don’t need to tell me!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.78,0:16:10.70,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Metamon, dodge!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:12.74,0:16:14.70,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,You’re open! Metamon! Bite!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.46,0:16:22.96,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.46,0:16:22.96,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,{\an8}Awright!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.97,0:16:38.10,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,What now? It turned back!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:38.10,0:16:42.11,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Look around! \N You gotta use anything you can in a fight!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.11,0:16:43.69,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Anything I can use...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.36,0:16:47.65,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Transform into Kairyu!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.28,0:16:52.70,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Ooh, you picked Kairyu?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.87,0:17:00.00,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Hehe! The tables turn! \N Metamon! Twister!
Comment: 10,0:17:09.05,0:17:09.84,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.43,0:17:14.85,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Metamon, put all your might \N into a Twister!{chikara ippai}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:26.73,0:17:28.74,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:35.37,0:17:38.79,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Danger incoming! \N Metamon, escape to the sky!{hm a kanji. 'What a dangerous feeling!' would match the Rockets. Hasn't come up in the show since... TOS 47, in a Rocket dialogue, used like 'He looks pretty dangerous' / 'He's got a pretty dangerous feeling to him'. Worth Rocket-consistency... In TOS sure, here idk.}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.62,0:17:43.63,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Ahh! It’s turning back again!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.96,0:17:47.50,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I’ve gotta do something!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.50,0:17:50.30,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Navi! Don’t take your gaze off Metamon!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.30,0:17:51.01,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,But—!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.51,0:17:53.84,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,You always gotta \N keep your partner in mind!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.84,0:17:55.89,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,The only one \N Metamon can rely on is you!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:01.02,0:18:03.65,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Metamon still hasn’t given up!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:03.65,0:18:04.98,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,And neither has Navi...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.52,0:18:06.52,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,That’s it!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:07.65,0:18:10.65,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Metamon! \N Transform into the rock you sleep as!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.79,0:18:26.04,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Whoa, that’s {\i1}hard!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:43.44,0:18:46.94,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,We did it... Metamon!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:49.78,0:18:53.03,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,That was great! \N That was the best!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:54.11,0:18:56.87,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.87,0:18:59.66,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,When I relaxed, \N all my strength suddenly just...{"suddenly all my strength" [left me]}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.16,0:19:04.04,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Are that little one’s fangs \N gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:04.04,0:19:05.42,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Don’t you worry!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:05.79,0:19:09.80,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Ratta’s teeth grow back naturally, \N even if they break off. I ain’t worried.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:09.80,0:19:12.55,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh... Ult, you know so much!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:12.55,0:19:15.76,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Course. ‘Cause I’ve been studyin’.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.55,0:19:19.72,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Hey, what did you think of our{Navi-tachi} battle?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.72,0:19:22.43,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Well, pretty good \N for a first-timer, I s’pose.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.68,0:19:25.19,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Ult, thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.85,0:19:30.57,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Still nowhere {\i1}near{\i0} \N being strongest, y’hear?!
Comment: 10,0:19:35.78,0:19:38.16,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.49,0:19:41.45,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Kairyu! Fly faster, like {\i1}whoosh!{\i}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:41.45,0:19:42.24,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Huh?{Kairyu: "Whooooosh!"}
Comment: 10,0:19:44.16,0:19:46.25,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Haha!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:46.25,0:19:48.88,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Kairyu, you’re amazing!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:58.43,0:20:00.05,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Oh, they’re back!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.85,0:20:07.10,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:08.52,0:20:09.81,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,We’re back...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.81,0:20:11.61,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Good work, you two.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.61,0:20:12.19,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:13.40,0:20:14.90,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Listen, listen!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.69,0:20:18.24,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I battled a wild Pokémon!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.24,0:20:20.62,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Metamon won against a Ratta!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.99,0:20:24.29,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,That’s amazing!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.33,0:20:28.67,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Hehe! Navi is Metamon’s trainer, \N after all!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.67,0:20:31.17,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Sounds like you had a fun adventure.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:31.17,0:20:32.92,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Ult, thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:33.34,0:20:36.21,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Well, I {\i1}am{\i0} her senior{Honorifics note: senpai}, after all!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:36.21,0:20:38.72,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,‘Course I’d support the newbie.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:39.30,0:20:41.97,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,By the way, you two... \N Where’s the stuff you went out for?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.97,0:20:43.31,Main,Ult Navi,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.31,0:20:45.64,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Aw, geez! \N I left it back in town!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.64,0:20:48.14,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,What’s with you?! \N You’re such a dope!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:48.14,0:20:49.52,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,{\i1}I{\i} had to go looking for {\i1}you—!{\i}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.52,0:20:51.52,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Enough! Just go get it already!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.52,0:20:53.40,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,No little kid’s orderin’ {\i1}me{\i0} around!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.40,0:20:55.15,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,{\i1}You’re{\i0} the little kid here, Ult!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.15,0:20:57.11,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,You always get mad so fast!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:57.11,0:20:58.28,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,What? I ain’t mad, got me?!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.28,0:20:59.40,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Yes you are!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.40,0:21:00.66,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Am not!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.42,0:21:13.71,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:15.17,0:21:16.71,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Time for breakfast!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:19.67,0:21:22.26,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Make sure you eat up good.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:22.26,0:21:25.10,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I see. So he does have a job.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:31.48,0:21:35.98,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, Metamon! \N You hungry too?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:36.94,0:21:37.69,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:42.16,0:21:43.24,Main,Navi,0,250,0,,They get along well.
Comment: 0,0:21:45.49,0:21:45.49,Main,,0,0,0,,{Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie A}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.91,0:21:48.29,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Friede here!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:48.29,0:21:52.08,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,It’s time to Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:53.00,0:21:55.13,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Today’s topic is Ratta!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:55.13,0:21:57.46,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,This Pokémon is \N more violent than it looks.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:57.46,0:22:01.51,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,{\q2}It has a chubby body, \N but do you know what part of it helps it keep balance?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:04.26,0:22:06.47,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,See the answer after the commercials!
Comment: 0,0:22:06.47,0:22:06.47,Main,,0,0,0,,{Ending}
Comment: 0,0:23:36.48,0:23:36.48,Main,,0,0,0,,{Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie B}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:40.40,0:23:42.40,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Time to announce \N the correct answer!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:42.40,0:23:43.86,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,The answer is...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:43.86,0:23:45.36,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,B: Its whiskers!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:45.36,0:23:50.37,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Ratta treasure their whiskers. \N Touch them, and they’ll get mad and Bite{move name conjugated} back!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:52.04,0:23:53.87,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Sorry about earlier.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:53.87,0:23:55.25,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Take this.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:56.62,0:23:57.75,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,{Ah, }Watch out...!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:58.71,0:24:00.50,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Comment: 0,0:24:00.50,0:24:00.50,Main,,0,0,0,,{Preview}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:01.50,0:24:02.50,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:02.50,0:24:03.88,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Whoa! What’s going on?!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:03.88,0:24:06.63,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Bringing you the choicest of scoops \N that’ll blow you away!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:06.63,0:24:10.22,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,This time, we delve into the riddles of \N the Pokémon lurking in the Land of Mystery!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:10.22,0:24:11.51,Main,Sohnano,0,0,0,,Sohnano!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:10.22,0:24:11.51,Main,TL Note,0,0,0,,{\c0\3c&HFFFFFF}{\fscx80\fscy80\blur4.5\pos(960,957)}That’s right!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:11.51,0:24:13.14,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Who’s this guy?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:14.52,0:24:16.94,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,A new member \N of the Rising Voltteccers, I take it?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:16.94,0:24:19.35,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,I’m Sohtim da Yotim, a.k.a. Sohdayo!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:19.35,0:24:20.86,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Ever pursuing the Unfabricated Truth—
Dialogue: 10,0:24:20.86,0:24:24.57,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,A-And so! To be continued \N next time on Pocket Monsters!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:24.57,0:24:27.57,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,{\q2}Astonishing! Mega Rekkuuza and the Land of Mystery?!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:27.57,0:24:28.57,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:28.57,0:24:30.45,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Mega Rekkuuza?!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,
