Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.47,0:02:01.48,OP,,0,0,0,,{\q2\pos(960,28)\blur5\bord7\c&HB7CB39&\3c&HB7CB39&\4c&HB7CB39&\xshad6\yshad3}Put our palms together, raise them high, and let our lights unite
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.99,0:02:16.62,OP,,0,0,0,,{\q2\pos(960,28)\blur5\bord7\c&HB7CB39&\3c&HB7CB39&\4c&HB7CB39&\xshad6\yshad3}In rain, gales, or even blizzards
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.62,0:02:19.33,OP,,0,0,0,,{\q2\pos(960,28)\blur5\bord7\c&HB7CB39&\3c&HB7CB39&\4c&HB7CB39&\xshad6\yshad3}We can laugh together as friends
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.33,0:02:22.00,OP,,0,0,0,,{\q2\pos(960,28)\blur5\bord7\c&HB7CB39&\3c&HB7CB39&\4c&HB7CB39&\xshad6\yshad3}All of the gaps in the Index
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.00,0:02:24.12,OP,,0,0,0,,{\q2\pos(960,28)\blur5\bord7\c&HB7CB39&\3c&HB7CB39&\4c&HB7CB39&\xshad6\yshad3}let’s fill them in bit by bit
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.12,0:02:25.83,OP,,0,0,0,,{\q2\pos(960,28)\blur5\bord7\c&HB7CB39&\3c&HB7CB39&\4c&HB7CB39&\xshad6\yshad3}If you’re trying to be someone else
